<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso22989/AicOecdLifecycleStage> OIO:inSubset <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso22989/aic_lifecycle> ;
	skos:inScheme "https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso22989"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:note "NIST's AI Risk Management Framework names the first six phases too, with deploy as deploy and use, and lmodel/nist-ai-100-1 renders them, so each maps to NIST's stage by close_mappings." , "The first six values are the phases the OECD Recommendation on Artificial Intelligence (OECD/LEGAL/0449) named when the standard was published, as the OECD Framework for the Classification of AI Systems (2022) draws them. The Recommendation as revised on 3 May 2024 names seven: it adds retiring or decommissioning, widens building to adapting a model that exists, and widens checking to testing and evaluation. The descriptions follow the revised text, read at legalinstruments.oecd.org on 2026-11-05, and retire_or_decommission is here for a record that follows it." ;
	linkml:annotations _:c14n55 , _:c14n91 ;
	linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso22989/AicOecdLifecycleStage"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	linkml:description "A phase of the OECD's account of an AI system's life, which Annex A sets beside the standard's." ;
