	skos:note "The rules hold each sub-role to the role its role annotation names, so a validator refuses a sub-role of another role. tests/test_data.py holds the rules and the annotations equal." , "UCO's Role is the function something has in context, which this record states for one party. A party with two roles has a record for each." ;
